["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/isan", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[International Standard Audiovisual Number (ISAN)](https://www.isan.org/about/#what_is_isan) is a unique 24-digit hexadecimal identifier for audiovisual works standardized by [ISO 15706](https://www.iso.org/standard/83124.html). The ISAN remains persistent for a work regardless of its distribution format or its use. To facilitate human readability, the \"ISAN\" label, grouping hyphens, and two check characters are included (e.g., `ISAN 0000-0000-3A8D-0000-Z-0000-0000-6`); however, these elements shall be omitted when the identifier is stored electronically (e.g., `000000003A8D000000000000`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifier", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property", "_:N739d6316e27a4454a2b7355b8edc3a61", "localId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/SupportType/deployed", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label", "deployed", "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/isrc", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[International Standard Recording Code (ISRC)](https://isrc.ifpi.org/isrc-standard) is a unique 12-character alphanumeric identifier for sound recordings and music video recordings standardized by [ISO 3901](https://www.iso.org/standard/64817.html). While the \"ISRC\" label and grouping hyphens used for human readability, they shall be omitted when the identifier is stored electronically (e.g., `USCA28900153`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/glue", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[GLobal Unique Enterprise (GLUE) Identifiers](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-spice-glue-id/), as defined by the IETF Internet-Draft, is expressed as a GLUE URI, a Uniform Resource Identifier that standardizes the representation of existing organizational entity identifiers.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/ContentIdentifierType/gitoid", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/ContentIdentifierType", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/quantity", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/review", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "A examination or checking of documentation, records, processes, or systems to confirm compliance or adherence with an upper level requirement. Typically done as peer review, offline review or review meeting.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/artifactSize", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty", "globalId", "", ""]
